15,"_gp_margin_vs_hist":true,"_score_margin_vs_hist":100.0,"_gate_piotroski":5,"_gp_piotroski":false,"_score_piotroski":55.6,"_gate_spread":null,"_gp_spread":null,"_score_spread":null,"_gate_roic_consistency":null,"_gp_roic_consistency":null,"_score_roic_consistency":null,"_gate_incr_roic":null,"_gp_incr_roic":null,"_score_incr_roic":null,"_gate_margin_advantage":null,"_gp_margin_advantage":null,"_score_margin_advantage":null,"_gate_pool_share":0.02500547949503029,"_gp_pool_share":true,"_score_pool_share":50.0,"_gate_rev_durability":0.18420667750309927,"_gp_rev_durability":true,"_score_rev_durability":100.0,"_gate_fcf_durability":null,"_gp_fcf_durability":null,"_score_fcf_durability":null,"_gate_margins":null,"_gp_margins":null,"_score_margins":null,"_gate_fund_growth":null,"_gp_fund_growth":null,"_score_fund_growth":null,"_gate_shrhldr_yield":0.013415355017676128,"_gp_shrhldr_yield":false,"_score_shrhldr_yield":26.0,"_gate_share_shrink":0.06893013675860038,"_gp_share_shrink":false,"_score_share_shrink":0.0,"_gate_sbc_dilution":0.010387440363900068,"_gp_sbc_dilution":true,"_score_sbc_dilution":82.7,"_gate_insider_own":0.0,"_gp_insider_own":false,"_score_insider_own":0.0,"_gate_insider_buying":0.0,"_gp_insider_buying":false,"_score_insider_buying":0.0,"pf":[],"description_full":"HDFC Bank Limited provides banking and financial products and services to individuals and businesses in India, Bahrain, Hong Kong, Singapore, and Dubai. The company operates through Treasury, Retail Banking, Wholesale Banking, Other Banking Business, Insurance Business, and Other segments. It offers savings, salary, current, rural, public provident fund, pension, and demat accounts; fixed and recurring deposits; and safe deposit lockers, as well as offshore accounts and deposits, and overdrafts against fixed deposits. The company also provides personal, home, car and pre owned car, marriage, two-wheeler, business, doctor, educational, gold, consumer, and rural loans; loans against properties, securities, mutual funds, and car; loans for professionals; government sponsored programs; and loans on credit card, as well as working capital, term loans, supply chain management, project finance, export finance, commercial vehicle / equipment finance, tractor finance, infrastructure, and agriculture finance. In addition, it offers credit, debit, prepaid, forex, and kisan gold cards; payment and collection, export, import, remittance, bank guarantee, letter of credit, trade, hedging, and merchant and cash management services; and insurance and investment products. Further, the company provides short term finance, bill discounting, structured finance, export credit, loan repayment, custodial, and documents collection services; online, mobile, and phone banking services; unified payment interface, immediate payment, national electronic funds transfer, and real time gross settlement services; channel financing, vendor financing, money market, derivatives, employee trusts, cash surplus corporates, tax payment, and bankers to rights/public issue services; and financial solutions for supply chain partners and agricultural customers. It operates branches and automated teller machines in various cities/towns. The company was incorporated in 1994 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Anup  Bagchi B.Tech, PGDM | MD, CEO & Director | Age 54","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 210K people. Revenue per employee of $124K ranks in the bottom quartile among Financial Services peers, improving at 16%/yr \u2014 growing workforce leverage. Each employee generates $59K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $1K per employee reflects an ownership culture.","financial_summary":["HDFC Bank Limited is a large-cap financial services business with a $129.3B market cap on $26.0B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +27% over the past three years and +18% annually across the full decade, the kind of sustained demand persistence that marks a compounder.","Returns on capital run at 9% against a 10% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests.","The business throws off $12.4B in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 48 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, and cash conversion sits at 1.78\u00d7 so those profits are backed by real cash.","On the balance sheet, debt is heavy at 8.5\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, and leverage like that is what turns a bad year into a permanent loss, and thin 0.5\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Shareholder yield is only 1.3%, a thin return of capital, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (0.3) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Value-trap profile (score 51/100): leveraged balance sheet under pressure; roic below cost of capital \u2014 cheapness may reflect deterioration, not mispricing","sev":"amber","cat":"value_trap"},{"text":"Carries more leverage than most Financial Services peers \u2014 a smaller cushion for the inevitable bad year","sev":"amber","cat":"balance_sheet"},{"text":"Above-average market volatility (VIX 26)","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Late-cycle dynamics increase the probability of a slowdown","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Credit cycles and regulatory capital \u2014 losses accumulate invisibly in good years and appear all at once, and the time to worry is when underwriting standards are loosest.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Fintech disintermediation \u2014 neobanks, embedded finance, and blockchain rails are unbundling the fee streams that traditional banks took for granted.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading at a 34% margin of safety to estimated fair value \u2014 a real cushion against errors in the estimate","Healthy payout ratio leaves room for both dividend growth and reinvestment","Growing faster than most Financial Services peers \u2014 taking share inside the profit pool","Minimal goodwill on the balance sheet \u2014 low impairment risk"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Muhurat Trading 2026: Equirus Prive's 16 Diwali picks include HDFC Bank, M&M, ESFB Voltas; upside seen up to 54%","source":"livemint.com","link":"https://www.livemint.com/market/stock-market-news/muhurat-trading-2026-equirus-prives-16-diwali-picks-include-hdfc-bank-m-m-esfb-voltas-upside-seen-up-to-54-11793974438126.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793977591.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.273,"tier":1,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"HDFC Bank Appoints Mr. V.N. Srivatsan as Chief Compliance Officer for a Three-Year Term","source":"kalkinemedia.com","link":"https://kalkinemedia.com/in/news/announcements/hdfc-bank-appoints-mr-vn-srivatsan-as-chief-compliance-officer-for-a-three-year-term","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793958660.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":1,"scope":"company","tags":["leadership"]},{"title":"HDFC Bank Appoints V.N. Srivatsan as Chief Compliance Officer for a Three-Year Term","source":"kalkinemedia.com","link":"https://kalkinemedia.com/in/news/announcements/hdfc-bank-appoints-vn-srivatsan-as-chief-compliance-officer-for-a-three-year-term","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793958660.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":1,"scope":"company","tags":["leadership"]},{"title":"Are banks open or closed on Dhanteras 2026? Check if SBI and HDFC Bank are operational on 6 November: RBI holiday list","source":"livemint.com","link":"https://www.livemint.com/money/personal-finance/are-banks-open-or-closed-on-dhanteras-2026-check-if-s